  m_text: 'How to Play



    Find all matching cards before time runs out.

    Each
    level has a move limit.

    Opening two cards counts as one move.

    If your
    time or moves run out, you lose one life.

    You have 3 lives for each level.

    Use
    Hint to reveal the cards for a short time.

    Complete all 10 levels to win.'
